# The compiled contract artifacts below are REQUIRED at app build time
# (the web dapp imports CHARGE_TOKEN_BYTECODE and the ABI to deploy tokens).
# Root .gitignore ignores `artifacts/`, so un-ignore the two files the app
# actually needs. They are regenerated by `pnpm --filter @charge/contracts build`
# (forge build) but must be committed so CI/Vercel can build without forge.
!artifacts/
!artifacts/bytecode.ts
!artifacts/ChargeToken.json
